    "chunk_text": "\u2018Senti - Talk to Your Fleet\u2019 takes Sri Lankan AI and IoT innovation to int\u2019l stage\n\nSoftlogic Information Technologies (Pvt) Ltd has secured a Bronze Award at the National ICT Awards \u2013 NBQSA 2026 for \u2018Senti \u2013 Talk to Your Fleet\u2019 in the Transport in Industrial category.\n\nThe company has also received the ASOCIO Digital & AI Award 2026 in the AI in Manufacturing / Supply Chain category, recognizing its work in applying artificial intelligence to business operations.\n\nTogether, these achievements show how Sri Lankan technology is increasingly being used to solve practical business challenges and demonstrate how the Internet of Things (IoT) and artificial intelligence (AI) can assist organizations in converting operational data into insights that can be put to use.\n\nKnowing the whereabouts of vehicles is just one aspect of the difficulties faced by businesses managing supply chains, transportation, and distribution. It is equally crucial to understand how they are driven, which vehicles need maintenance, and how fleet data might influence operational decisions. By combining AI and IoT, Senti - Talk to Your Fleet meets this demand by offering real-time fleet operations visibility and supporting more informed decision-making.\n\nSenti helps organizations better understand fleet activity and make more informed operational decisions by connecting vehicle data with intelligent insights. Its applications are relevant to industries where vehicle utilization, delivery reliability, and operational visibility are critical to daily operations, such as manufacturing, retail, healthcare, agriculture, and public transport."
  },
